          "id": "f6df16b98aa6840aee905d7d88f340fe0f2763c5",
          "message": "[ci][mesh] support Crusoe cluster and align bench_seving script on SA (#1730)\n\n* [ci][mesh] fix enable_prefix_caching\n\n[ci][mesh] Add support for service setting disable_prefix_caching\n\n[ci][mesh] fix DISABLE_PREFIX_CACHING env.\n\n* [ci][mesh] support Crusoe MI355X cluster\n\n* Add ATOMesh Slurm partition override\n\n* Fix ATOMesh benchmark dispatch concurrency\n\n* [ci][mesh] fix ATOMesh single-node DPA port conflicts\n\n* [ci][mesh] fix ATOMesh Slurm job cancellation race\n\n* [ci][mesh] fix QOSGrpNodeLimit for crusoe cluster\n\n* align bench_seving script on SA\n\n* [ci][mesh] reuse GLM agentic LMCache env anchors\n\n* [ci][mesh] update case list description for workflow dispatch\n\n* [ci][mesh] read Spur Slurm status from accounting\n\n* [ci][mesh] remove unsupported GLM agtentic pcp-dpa cases\n\n* [ci][mesh] add targeted TW weekday nightly for DeepSeek-V4 & GLM-5.2 Agentic cases",
