          "message": "[AIPerf] bump to v1.0.1: count-based warmup, timing watchdog, realtime metrics (#1785)\n\nUpgrade AIPerf from 0.8.0 (commit 0d2aa05) to v1.0.1 (commit b7b16cf).\n\nKey changes aligned with InferenceX PR #2415 and #2484:\n- --agentic-cache-warmup-duration → --warmup-requests-per-lane (default 10)\n- Add --trace-idle-gap-cap-seconds 300 (per-trajectory timing watchdog)\n- Add --stats-interval 30 (realtime TTFT/ITL/throughput block)\n- Add AIPERF_UI_REALTIME_METRICS_ENABLED=true env var\n- Update aiperf commit in CI config, scripts, and all recipe docs",
